	{
		{"se", id=1, file=08000, vol=88},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"wa", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010020c"},
		line=1078,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Akari and I return home together.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Welcome back. How was school?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Awfully stimulating.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You must be exhausted. Would you like me to Heal you again?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yes please, but in a bit.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“An unfamiliar lifestyle can be more stressful than you might think.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“If you ever need anything, don't hesitate to let me know.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It's like I always say: A landlord and his tenant are like parent and child.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The manager answers Akari's gratitude with a wave of his hand and goes back to work in the store.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you working now, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I'll be out on delivery until about eight.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Koujiya Flowers opens every morning at ten and closes at eight in the evening.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"After we close up, I usually grab dinner at Miyoshi with the manager and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you want to go out on delivery with me?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't think I'll be able to help with any manual labor in my condition.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can just sit in the passenger seat. I want to show you around Tenkyo while we're out.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Deal!”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then let's get changed and meet back here in fifteen minutes.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I load the packaged flowers into the back of the van.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Akari is sitting in the passenger seat.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"I sense another fragrance mingling with the aroma of the flowers inside the vehicle.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Buckle your seat belt.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“O-Oh, this thing?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Akari mimics me and tries to buckle up.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? It's not going in... Huh, does this go here?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, it's over here.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I take the latch from Akari's hands and fasten it for her.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Agagagh, you're being too rough!”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't use your warrior strength on me.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Come to think of it, I've never interacted before with a regular girl in terms of physical strength.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I confirm her safety more carefully than usual and start the van.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"It's been a long time since I've had a woman sit next to me.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I remember hearing somewhere long ago that the sight of a woman in your passenger seat is a beautiful one.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"I give Akari a sidelong glance.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(I see. Beautiful indeed.)”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The evening sun streaming in through the window colors her cheeks with a seemingly natural blush.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Those clothes look great on you.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Where'd that come from?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I only said what I felt.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You sure like doing that, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Akari faces the other way.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Silence ensues.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Heh, hehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's just funny to think of a warrior working as a flowerboy.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Especially since you still have this real 'warrior' vibe about you.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What impression do I give off?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Unsophisticated, unrefined... not to mention totally expressionless!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I get that a lot...”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"I probably give off the exact opposite impression of how flower shop employees usually are.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's easy to forget, but this job does involve manual labor. It takes plenty of muscle.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I briefly summarize all the various duties of a florist.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Akari, full of curiosity, listens to my entire spiel without interrupting once.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And I thought this job was just about arranging bouquets.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I thought so too.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But if you compare it to being a fishmonger, arranging bouquets would be like making sashimi.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So it's just one small part of the bigger picture.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Exactly.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Without any expertise, running deliveries is one of the only ways I can make myself useful.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're at our first stop. I'll be right back.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I immediately head for the next one.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"As night falls, the state of the city changes before our very eyes.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“More Republicans are showing up now that the sun has set. Are they all soldiers?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There are sixty thousand Republican soldiers garrisoned in Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're mostly single men, and they go out on the city in droves.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The first thing Tenkyo was forced into after the war was taking care of these men's desires.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't need to spell it out for you, do I?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Muggings, robbery, murder, and more.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Tenkyo's streets overflow with every kind of violence there is.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Things haven't changed even one bit.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"I stop the car on the shoulder of the road.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"About forty percent of passersby are wearing Republican Army uniforms.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, look!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Akari directs my attention to a nearby Imperial restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Inside, we can see a soldier savagely beating an Imperial employee.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"People nearby are pretending they don't see anything.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey! Go help that guy.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, but that's easier said than done.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I seize her hand as it reaches for the seat belt.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we intervene, we'll only turn their anger on us. That employee doesn't want that.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The employee collapses onto the floor under the soldier's fist.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I feel my blood boiling.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Even so, I grit my teeth tight and endure.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Republicans aren't punished for anything they do. It's part of the peace treaty Okonogi signed.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Specifically, the clause that 'Imperials shall not pass judgment on Republicans,' huh?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Akari seemingly struggles to even spit out the words.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A while back, there was a drunkard who went on a rampage and shot up an entire place.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Six people died and twenty-three others were wounded. Several of the deaths were children.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They caught the shooter, but ultimately, he was only repatriated.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This sort of thing happens every other day.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So what, I'm just supposed to overlook all this injustice?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I start the van moving again.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"As we speed up, the scenery melds into a stream of lights.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Beautiful at a distance yet unsightly when up close─that is Tenkyo at night.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Akari stares forward with an obviously displeased expression.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've gotten used to seeing that, haven't you?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Everyone in Tenkyo gets used to it.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In other words, you've already forgotten how to get angry.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Her tone is a mixture of provocation and disillusionment.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd jump right in there if I could...”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wonder.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Back at school, all you did was stand there and take it.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Trying to not draw attention, not stand out, just holding it all in. You just watch while doing nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Saving a single person won't accomplish anything.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Unless we change all of society, these problems won't go away.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Keep telling yourself that and you'll never change a single thing.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Believe me, it wrenches my insides too.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"I'd love nothing more than to charge the Imperial Palace right this instant.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"The only reason I hold myself back is my ambition to someday restore the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then what would you do?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you think assassinating Okonogi will save these people?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm going to avenge my mother. That's all.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you're going to call yourself the Imperial Princess, you should think seriously about the future of your country.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't wanna hear it from a warrior who does nothing but watch.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're a true warrior, you should be taking action.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Akari spits out her words without even looking in my direction.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"The final delivery of the day is at the mansion of a commissioned officer in the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whew, I'm beat.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's got you all exhausted?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He tried to stiff me on the bill. Well, it happens all the time.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That does it. I'm gonna go take those flowers back!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait, wait, wait. It's fine. I managed to get the payment.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Dealing with difficult Republicans is part of the job.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've got it rough... Good job today.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I sit in the front seat and pull up a map of Tenkyo on my tablet computer.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mind if we make a detour?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I want to check out a certain road.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inspecting a road? Do you have a side job in construction?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Akari gives me a puzzled look.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Truthfully, I intentionally showed her the map so I could tell her about the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have you heard of the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course I have!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They're the very embodiment of fealty! I thought for sure\nthey'd take Okonogi down.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But... they failed.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Founded shortly after the war, the Sworn Blades were unfortunately crushed by the student council president before our goals could be realized.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Sworn Blades aren't finished yet.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We were pushed to the brink of destruction, but the surviving warriors are biding their time for their chance to strike back.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Biding their time?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Akari's eyes open wide.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Sworn Blades are really still alive?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"I nod my head in response.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Our ultimate mission is to strike Okonogi down and restore the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Akari's eyes are wide with wonder.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Within the depths of her amaranthine eyes, astonishment and joy swirl about in equal measure.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They're really still fighting.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I heard they were annihilated, so I thought...”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No matter how bleak the situation, a warrior's duty is unyielding.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even down to the last, he shall live only for the sake of his fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Akari draws a sharp breath.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haha, hehehee... How funny.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You haven't changed even one bit.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"A single peach petal drifts across my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"It must have flown in from the back of the van.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This was during the war, when you were about to go fight the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I said you couldn't do it alone.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you think you said to me?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"What would I have said to her?",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Only one answer comes to mind.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“'Whether they number one or a hundred, my duty is\nunyielding,' I suppose?”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Exactly!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Akari takes both of my hands in her own.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"The moment our hands touch, a war cry rings in my ears.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Gunshots, explosions, roars, screams─",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"The symphony of the battlefield slowly comes into focus inside my head.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"On the day the Republic army attacked, I─",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"I walked down this very road.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"I don't know what my goal was, but I'm certain that I passed by this place.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"For the first time since I lost my memories, I have a recollection of events that happened during the war.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can we follow this road for a bit? I think my memories are coming back.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Absolutely. Go right ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"I head down the main artery of the Republican occupation zone.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"The ever familiar road seems somehow fresh all of a sudden.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"The streetlights streaming past make me feel like I'm traversing a tunnel through time.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"I can't remember anything concrete, but the mere knowledge that I was once here makes me indescribably happy.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Never knew you could make a face like that.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What sort of face?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm, like a child who just received a treat?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How unbecoming of someone my age.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't think it's such a bad thing.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"She says, propping her chin up on her armrest.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think you could stand to be a bit more emotional.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's good that you're so serious at heart, but you never turn it off.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maybe you can share some of that overly emotional side of yours with me.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey! I've got nothing to do with this.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Er... On second thought, I guess I actually do.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"She sighs as she suddenly remembers.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sorry for what I did at school.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're part of the Sworn Blades, you must've been on pins and needles watching me.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And, um... I treated you like you're some kind of coward.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" a coward. I absolutely can't afford to be arrested before I fulfill my duty.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's caution, not cowardice.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And here I went and... Aaah! It hurts just thinking about it!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"She bangs her head against the window.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just be more careful from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right, I'm so sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"She bangs her head against the window once more for good measure.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I stop the van.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"We arrive at the base of the long steps leading to the Imperial Palace─the residence of generations of Emperors.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Even if you have a visa to enter the Republican occupation zone, no entry is permitted beyond here.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's a bit vague, but I do remember having come here during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What for?”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't remember.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's the point if you can't even remember that much?!”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Akari roughly bangs her fist on the side of the van.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"But she soon remembers herself.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry about that. It isn't easy for you either, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm glad you understand.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"I stare at the vermilion gates looming in the darkness, but I still can't recall anything.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"According to Hotori, I'd been here several times before the war.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Unlike House Inou, which sits at the highest echelon of warrior society, House Tokita is only of average status.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Such that if I had the chance to enter the Imperial Palace,\nI'd surely remember it as the greatest honor of my life.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In the past, I could've just strolled straight up these stairs.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"She narrows her eyes in melancholic recollection.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“See that guardhouse over there? I hid there during hide-and-seek once.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nobody could find me at all, and the whole palace was all in a tizzy.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mother totally blew up on me afterwards...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've been a hoyden all your life, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All my life? I'm gonna pretend I didn't hear that.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Akari puffs out her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"But she soon reverts back to a stern expression.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right. I've been thinking since yesterday, but you think we could prove my lineage with the Three Sacred Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"The Three Sacred Treasures are legendary artifacts that are spoken of in the Imperial Chronicles and serve as proof of the Imperial line.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"They're usually hidden away inside the palace, only displayed in public on important occasions such as the enthronement ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"The three treasures consist of a blade, a mirror, and a magatama.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"The blade is said to be capable of cutting down any calamity, and the mirror is said to confer protection against any calamity.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Finally, the magatama is said to bestow its holder with all worldly knowledge.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"It is said that when wielded by the Empress, these artifacts are capable of granting power which rivals that of the gods.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"If Akari could get her hands on the Three Sacred Treasures, there would be nobody in all the Empire who could doubt her lineage.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you know how to use the Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, I've got no idea.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then what would you do when crisis is upon us? The Three Sacred Treasures are the country's last line of defense!”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, don't ask me that...”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"She sheepishly scratches her cheek.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“During the last war, did Empress Suou not use the Three Sacred Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My guess is...”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“By the time the first explosion happened in the palace and I went running to Mother...”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi had already murdered her.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see... Sorry for dredging up unpleasant memories.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"If the Three Sacred Treasures had actually been used, the Empire could not have possibly lost.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Since Okonogi planned to sell out the Empire to the Republic, he must have killed Empress Suou before she had the chance.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Getting back on track, how can we find the Three Sacred Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, that.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's this temple behind the palace called",
{"ruby", text="Celestial Pavilion"},
" the Shireiden. I ",
{"/ruby"},
"think they might be there.” ",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So you're saying I need to bring you there.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Exactly.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like it's worth a shot.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You bet it is.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If we can prove my lineage, a whole lot of things will go a whole lot smoother.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Plus, Inou'll stop trying to kill me.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"That said, the Imperial Palace is protected by Okonogi's two thousand-strong Forbidden Guard.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"Security is tight, and even our spy, Koyuzu, hasn't been able to infiltrate very deep.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"I'll have to think of a way.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
